[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":98},["ShallowReactive",2],{"blog:archive:interview:3":3},{"posts":4,"total":86,"tags":87,"tag":13},[5,14,22,30,38,46,54,62,70,78],{"title":6,"link":7,"date":8,"dateTime":9,"description":10,"thumbnail":11,"tags":12},"老闆不會為你規劃人生。未來想成為什麼？是自己決定的！-- Kanboo","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-01-03-interview","2019\u002F01\u002F03","2019-01-03","Kanboo 的前一份工作是在專案公司，協助竹科、金融企業內部系統開發，遇過許多不同的企業需求與企業文化，這個經歷對 Kanboo 的人生規劃有著很大的影響，Kanboo 感謝家人願意支持他轉職的決心，現在他是一名前端工程師。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F01%2Fblog-cover-Kanboo.png?alt=media&token=add3a589-38a5-49bb-9da6-420915dcce26",[13],"interview",{"title":15,"link":16,"date":17,"dateTime":18,"description":19,"thumbnail":20,"tags":21},"【公開】如何在線上幫助學員找到前端工作","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-08-27-interview","2018\u002F08\u002F27","2018-08-27","各位好，我是六角學院的校長，洧杰，創校兩年來，我們在線上已協助超過 100 位學員錄取網頁設計師、前端工程師職缺。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F08%2Fofferget_fb.png?alt=media&token=d69db149-1486-4785-bcd4-0f4078d6a20f",[13],{"title":23,"link":24,"date":25,"dateTime":26,"description":27,"thumbnail":28,"tags":29},"行政轉戰前端工程師，「即戰力」是她的學習訴求 -- Clara","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-06-19-interview","2018\u002F06\u002F19","2018-06-19","Clara，雖是資管出身，面對業界要的[即戰力]，體認到學校所學的理論是不夠的！出社會幾年都是擔任行政職務，之後有了薪資方面的考量，開始立志要當「前端工程師」","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F06%2F%E7%9A%93%E7%90%B3.png?alt=media&token=b269c00b-2694-4c33-8e3e-d383b231c32e",[13],{"title":31,"link":32,"date":33,"dateTime":34,"description":35,"thumbnail":36,"tags":37},"總是從錯誤中學習，置之死地而後生 - 阿陰","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-06-18-interview","2018\u002F06\u002F18","2018-06-18","無關科系，沒有程式底子沒關係！只要有學習熱情","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F06%2Fryin.png?alt=media&token=6fb5f324-c96d-439f-968d-6c6676463152",[13],{"title":39,"link":40,"date":41,"dateTime":42,"description":43,"thumbnail":44,"tags":45},"問自己未來想要什麼？我選擇與時俱進的工作 -- Joseph","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-06-17-interview","2018\u002F06\u002F17","2018-06-17","從事過設計助理、數位廣告代理商業務、倉管，在開始思考未來方向之際看到了六角學院，開啟了 coding 人生。半年內，一家大型電商公司主動聯繫，現在擔任前端工程師一職","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F06%2F%E5%98%89%E8%B1%90.png?alt=media&token=0330137d-6221-423f-bd24-ac4116a93854",[13],{"title":47,"link":48,"date":49,"dateTime":50,"description":51,"thumbnail":52,"tags":53},"只要想著半年後的樣子，這樣的喜悅就能擊敗學習的孤獨感 - Greene","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-06-16-interview","2018\u002F06\u002F16","2018-06-16","跟朋友創業，為了自架網站，我重拾大學荒廢的學科，加入線上課程，雖然以資工背景出身，我依然從零開始","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F06%2FGreene.png?alt=media&token=9ac54c5b-9785-4568-9a16-f03bf294d5de",[13],{"title":55,"link":56,"date":57,"dateTime":58,"description":59,"thumbnail":60,"tags":61},"專精一職，涉略所有，才能有無限可能 - Simon","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-06-15-interview","2018\u002F06\u002F15","2018-06-15","Simon 非資工相關科系畢業，在畢業前因為大學教授的一句話，開始接觸前端技術，加入了六角學院學習前端技術，但因南部相關職缺少之又少且待遇並不是很友善，決定北上另尋機會，且已順利找到第二份前端工程師工作。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F06%2Fsimon.png?alt=media&token=5721dbaa-202b-45c8-acaa-c02ac9a634b7",[13],{"title":63,"link":64,"date":65,"dateTime":66,"description":67,"thumbnail":68,"tags":69},"年紀的追趕下，擁有專業技能，才能踏實完成每一步 -- Chelsea","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-12-04-interview","2018\u002F01\u002F04","2018-01-04","大眾傳播系畢業後，從事廣告公司平面相關，工作的性質比較偏與人溝通想法，沒有實際自己動手完成的經驗，覺得工作總是出一張嘴，感覺很不踏實，在 2016 年國外打工回國後，認為應該培養一技之長，決定踏入前端這個深不見底的大坑(笑)","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F01%2Finterview_chelsea.jpg?alt=media&token=9b8374ca-1f94-47bc-9c14-d8ca7819afe0",[13],{"title":71,"link":72,"date":73,"dateTime":74,"description":75,"thumbnail":76,"tags":77},"學習前端半年，畢業即就業 -- 世軒","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-12-03-interview","2018\u002F01\u002F03","2018-01-03","很享受現在的工作生活，連女友的躍躍欲試，開始學習前端了！目前公司的前端、後端人員各一位，沒有前輩帶領的工作有好有壞，我可以獨當一面完成很多事，當然遇到問題無人可以解答時，我也會請教老師(笑)","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F01%2Finterview_%E4%B8%96%E8%BB%92.jpg?alt=media&token=192b56f8-0917-4d1f-9b3f-454f2902cae2",[13],{"title":79,"link":80,"date":81,"dateTime":82,"description":83,"thumbnail":84,"tags":85},"兩個月保險業務轉職前端，分享如何“學習” -- 引擎","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-12-20-interview","2017\u002F12\u002F20","2017-12-20","引擎，一名保險業務員，只花兩個月成為前端工程師，進入業界。喜愛旅行的他在環遊世界半年間，因緣際會認識了遠端工作者，開始嚮往這樣的工作型態...","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F12%2Finterview_engine.jpg?alt=media&token=779012a2-9211-4093-9fa3-f63eee9d887a",[13],40,[88,89,90,91,92,93,13,94,95,96,97],"UI design","course","css","css3","enterprise","event","javascript","jobs","skilltree","software engineer",1790064291813]